<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 57,761 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 57,761 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 57,761 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Monday, compared to 86,292 tonnes on in the previous 24 hours.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Monday	   Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			 7,982	   12,725</p>
<p>    Import cargo			49,779	   73,567</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, six ships sailed and five berthed. In the next 24 hours, six ships were expected to sail and seevn were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
